<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/slate-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/slate-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/slate-roof.webp 1000w" sizes="100vw" width="1000" height="667" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/">Calculators</a></li><li aria-current="page">Roof Square &amp; Pitch Calculator</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator · nothing stored</p><h1>Roof Squares Calculator for Maryland Roof Claims</h1><p class="lede">Roof claims are often argued in squares. Convert a simple footprint into true surface area with pitch and waste, then compare the result with the insurer’s diagram.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool" data-tool="roof">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Roof square &amp; pitch calculator</span><i>Check the carrier’s roof math</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <fieldset class="bare"><legend class="sr-only">Measurement method</legend>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <label class="check"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="dims" checked> Footprint length × width</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="area"> I know the footprint area</label>
        </div></fieldset>
      <div class="row2" data-mode="dims">
        <div><label for="r-l">Footprint length (ft)</label><input id="r-l" name="len" inputmode="decimal" value="48"></div>
        <div><label for="r-w">Footprint width (ft)</label><input id="r-w" name="wid" inputmode="decimal" value="30"></div>
      </div>
      <div data-mode="dims"><label for="r-oh">Eave overhang (inches)</label><input id="r-oh" name="oh" inputmode="decimal" value="12"></div>
      <div data-mode="area" hidden><label for="r-a">Footprint area incl. overhangs (sq ft)</label><input id="r-a" name="area" inputmode="decimal" value="1650"></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="r-p">Roof pitch (rise per 12)</label><select id="r-p" name="pitch"><option value="1">1/12</option><option value="2">2/12</option><option value="3">3/12</option><option value="4">4/12</option><option value="5">5/12</option><option value="6">6/12</option><option value="7">7/12</option><option value="8" selected>8/12</option><option value="9">9/12</option><option value="10">10/12</option><option value="12">12/12</option><option value="14">14/12</option><option value="16">16/12</option><option value="18">18/12</option></select><span class="hint">Rowhouse membrane roofs are often 1/12 or less.</span></div>
        <div><label for="r-wst">Waste factor</label><select id="r-wst" name="waste"><option value="5">5% — low-slope membrane</option><option value="10">10% — simple gable</option><option value="13" selected>13% — gable with dormers</option><option value="15">15% — hip roof</option><option value="18">18% — cut-up / turrets</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div><label for="r-pr">Installed price per square (optional)</label><input id="r-pr" name="price" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 575"><span class="hint">Use a local contractor’s quote for a rough figure.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>Roof squares (before waste)</small><b data-o="sq">0</b></div>
      <div class="out-rows">
        <div><span>Pitch multiplier</span><b data-o="mult">1.000</b></div>
        <div><span>Roof surface area</span><b data-o="surface">0</b></div>
        <div><span>Squares to order (with waste)</span><b data-o="order">0</b></div>
        <div><span>Shingle bundles (3 per square)</span><b data-o="bundles">0</b></div>
        <div><span>Rough replacement cost</span><b data-o="cost">—</b></div>
      </div>
      <p class="out-msg" data-o="steep"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They are not a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>Why pitch changes everything</h2>
<p>A roof square is 100 sq ft of actual roof surface. Steeper roofs have more surface than their footprint suggests: an 8/12 roof is about 20% larger than its plan area, a 12/12 roof about 41% larger. If an estimate was built from a satellite footprint without the right pitch, the square count — and every line tied to it — will be low.</p>
<h2>Waste factors in practice</h2>
<p>Waste covers the shingles cut away at hips, valleys and rakes. A simple gable might need 10%; a cut-up Queen Anne roof in Frederick or Hagerstown may need 18% or more. Flat membrane roofs on Baltimore rowhouses need far less. Check that the estimate’s waste matches the roof you actually have.</p>
<h2>Steep and high charges</h2>
<p>Most estimating platforms add steep-roof labor from about 7/12 and high-roof charges for two-story eaves. These lines are easy to miss. See our <a href="/property-claim-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/">roof &amp; hail damage appraisal</a> page for other common gaps.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>How do I find my roof pitch?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Measure the rise over 12 inches of run with a level and tape from the attic or at a gable end, or check aerial measurement reports. Don’t climb a roof to measure it.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does this replace a roof measurement report?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>No. It’s a reasonableness check. For appraisal, use a measured diagram or an aerial report.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="rel"><a href="/appraisal-calculators/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Claim Timeline Planner</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/appraisal-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checklist/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Appraisal Readiness Checklist</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-in"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-h">Talk to an appraiser</h2><p>A free first conversation about your estimate — and a straight answer on whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="box-tel" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg>(844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn brass block" href="/start-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri, 8am–6pm ET</small></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-h">All calculators</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-worksheet/">RCV / ACV &amp; Holdback Worksheet<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/roof-square-pitch-calculator/" aria-current="page">Roof Square &amp; Pitch Calculator<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">Hurricane Deductible Calculator<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">Claim Timeline Planner<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="ro